# Azure pin edge (AINav.Institute)

## Scope
- Public static edge only. **Does not admit.** No dual tokens, no SoR writes here.
- LIVE_PIN_OK: `https://ainav.institute/health.json` is JSON with `policy_digest` (not Squarespace/HTML).

## Endpoints (mothership/www)
- `/healthz.json` — LB/FD probe: `{status:ok, admit:false}`
- `/health.json` — pin integrity (release_id, policy_digest)
- Keep pin paths in `staticwebapp.config.json` routes + `navigationFallback.exclude` with `Cache-Control: no-store`.

## Deploy & verify
```bash
python3 scripts/check_azure_swa_health.py --local --strict
bash mothership/azure/deploy-swa.sh
python3 scripts/check_azure_swa_health.py --url https://<swa-host> --strict
python3 scripts/check_azure_swa_health.py --public --require-live
```

## Front Door
- Probe path: **`/healthz.json`** @ **30s** balanced (15 aggressive / 60 conservative).
- WAF **AllowPinJson** must include `/healthz.json` and `/health.json`.
- Alerts: OriginHealthPercentage < 100%; OriginLatency > baseline (default 2000ms).
- Scripts: `configure-front-door-probe.sh`, `configure-front-door-alerts.sh`.

## Log Analytics / KQL
- Wire diagnostics: `configure-log-analytics-diagnostics.sh`
- Default KQL: `front-door-probe-latency-summary.kql`, `waf-pin-hits.fast.kql`
- Selectivity order: time → Category == → path has_any → project → summarize → take
- Prefer metric alerts for health; KQL for path detail. No dual-schema on hot path.

## Index
- `mothership/azure/README.md` — full catalog
- `docs/AZURE_SWA_HEALTH_CHECKS.md` — health ops
- `mothership/azure/LOG_ANALYTICS_INTEGRATION.md` — LAW wiring

## Anti-patterns
- Probing `/` or HTML (parking looks healthy)
- SPA fallback rewriting `/health.json`
- Claiming LIVE_PIN_OK while public returns HTML
- Putting admit/policy engines on the static edge
